1
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:52,208
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,380
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,872
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,888 --> 00:00:58,880
=Episode 14=

5
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:00,759
Hey.

6
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:01,479
You're here.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,239
Boss, let me introduce someone.

8
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:05,799
This is...

9
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:06,519
You're not dead?

10
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:07,359
This...

11
00:01:24,239 --> 00:01:26,000
After you guys left that day,

12
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,599
the police rescued me.

13
00:01:28,599 --> 00:01:29,000
Boss.

14
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,000
You two know each other?

15
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,200
I know it's my fault
the police are after you.

16
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,640
I was too ashamed to face you.

17
00:01:37,319 --> 00:01:38,400
If I'd known you were here,

18
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,159
I wouldn't have come.

19
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,359
Where are you going?

20
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,519
Back...

21
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:44,799
where I came from.

22
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:46,239
No way.

23
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,959
You don't belong in the slums.

24
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,079
Boss.

25
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:51,400
Daya saved me when Tai tried to kill me.

26
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,439
Why not let her stay?

27
00:01:59,159 --> 00:01:59,640
Boss.

28
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,239
I'm begging you.

29
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,000
She saved you.

30
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:08,000
If you want her to stay, that's fine.

31
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,319
Okay.

32
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:09,840
Daya.

33
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,800
There's an empty room over there.

34
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,280
I'll take you.

35
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:11,840
Let's go.

36
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,719
You can stay there from now on.

37
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:40,879
Oh!

38
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:41,280
Ma Ding.

39
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,719
What are you doing?

40
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,479
I'll do it.

41
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:48,919
I'll do it.

42
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,560
Cut it like this.

43
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,319
What about mine?

44
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,400
There's more in the pot.

45
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,199
Go get some yourself.

46
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:24,800
Dinner's ready!

47
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,919
Come eat!

48
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:53,879
What are you doing?

49
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:56,639
Boss.

50
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,800
You've already got two girlfriends.

51
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,039
Please let me have Daya.

52
00:04:01,039 --> 00:04:01,840
What two girlfriends?

53
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Don't listen to Ma Ding. He's lying.

54
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:09,400
Then tell me.

55
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,599
Which one do you actually like?

56
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,280
What do you mean, "like"?

57
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,280
Don't talk nonsense!

58
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,319
I'll pick one for you.

59
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,160
That pretty cop, Mona.

60
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:19,800
Keep talking,
and I'll tape your mouth shut.

61
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,639
That bowl's for you.

62
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,399
Where are you going?

63
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,279
Got something to do.

64
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:18,959
That's very thoughtful of you, Mr. Mian.

65
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,800
But...

66
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:23,839
Why not red roses?

67
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:25,560
I don't know why.

68
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,240
These just felt more like you.

69
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:31,920
Thank you.

70
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,399
I love them.

71
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,279
Did it work?

72
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:41,480
Yep.

73
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,000
Then let's celebrate with a dance.

74
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,759
I really don't know how.

75
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,639
That's perfect. I'll teach you.

76
00:06:12,199 --> 00:06:12,720
Get out!

77
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,639
Your stepson...

78
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:18,360
doesn't seem too happy to see me.

79
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,319
You've misunderstood, Mr. Mian.

80
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,959
Look how welcoming he is.

81
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,399
Mian, huh?

82
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,399
Touch her again,

83
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,319
and I'll shoot you dead!

84
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,199
Can't take it already?

85
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,199
You took my girl from me.

86
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:36,560
Now I get to be your stepdad.

87
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,000
We're even, right?

88
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:40,560
You got a death wish?

89
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:45,199
Move.

90
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,040
Sorry, Mr. Mian.

91
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:47,959
Looks like

92
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,800
we'll have to end dinner

93
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,240
here tonight.

94
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:52,639
No worries.

95
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:55,120
We'll have plenty of time.

96
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,680
You got a death wish?

97
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,160
You're trying to get me a stepdad?

98
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,399
You think I won't...

99
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:08,240
You think I won't shoot you?

100
00:07:11,199 --> 00:07:11,920
Mr. Natuo.

101
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,240
Control yourself.

102
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:15,959
Let him go.

103
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:24,160
I'm just having dinner with Mr. Mian.

104
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:26,480
Now that he's working with Suowen,

105
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,560
for Songcai Group's sake,

106
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,480
shouldn't I side with the stronger man?

107
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:34,879
Mian's working with Suowen?

108
00:07:35,839 --> 00:07:36,519
No way.

109
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:37,920
You've been fooled.

110
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,120
He's just using you for protection.

111
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:43,399
Am I being fooled,
or are you just out of the loop?

112
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:44,519
Go check for yourself.

113
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:52,759
(Boss.)

114
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:53,360
(Bad news.)

115
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:55,240
(Tai was attacked by Suowen's men.)

116
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:56,800
What?

117
00:07:59,399 --> 00:08:00,600
Wu Suowen must be tired of living.

118
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:02,439
Get the men.

119
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:13,759
Stop.

120
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,040
Are you crazy?

121
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:24,879
If you've got the guts, kill me.

122
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,680
How could I let you die?

123
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:31,279
I need you to stay alive.

124
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,320
Suowen.

125
00:08:41,559 --> 00:08:43,000
Are you out of your mind?

126
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:44,960
You actually teamed up with Mian

127
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,279
to come after me?

128
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,000
You wanna get yourself killed?

129
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:48,840
Natuo.

130
00:08:49,799 --> 00:08:51,799
Who's been cutting my stuff

131
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,120
and stealing my customers?

132
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:55,200
You've been lying to me.

133
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,519
You want me dead.

134
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:00,600
Get up.

135
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,759
Then I'll find my own way to stay alive.

136
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:05,720
What are you doing?

137
00:09:07,039 --> 00:09:07,759
You're holding him hostage?

138
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:09,440
What good will that do?

139
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,639
I've got plenty of men.

140
00:09:11,919 --> 00:09:12,919
I can spare one.

141
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,720
Nice shot!

142
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,840
My heart!

143
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,240
My heart!

144
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:25,200
My heart!

145
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,600
My heart!

146
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,360
- Boss!
- Boss!

147
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,639
Go!

148
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:32,799
After them!

149
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:36,159
They're finally at each other's throats.

150
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:36,919
Boss.

151
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:37,840
You're amazing.

152
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,720
So now it's up to Miss Mona.

153
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,639
We may not be able to
count on the Langia police.

154
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,440
Get the Blaze Gang together.

155
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:45,879
It's time to move.

156
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:47,720
Okay.

157
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,080
Dad.

158
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:55,120
Natuo and Suowen
have turned on each other.

159
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,120
The fight's moved to the hospital.

160
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,399
We'll send people right now.

161
00:09:57,879 --> 00:09:59,720
We can nail Suowen for drug smuggling

162
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,879
and the organ trafficking

163
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:01,799
all in one sweep.

164
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:03,840
Mona.

165
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,720
Suowen's been in Langia for years.

166
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:08,240
Do you know how much backing

167
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,200
he has?

168
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,279
The higher-ups...

169
00:10:10,559 --> 00:10:11,440
a lot of them

170
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:13,039
are covering this up.

171
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:14,720
Dad.

172
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,759
Isn't Langia like this
because of those corrupt officials?

173
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:18,879
That's why people like Suowen, Natuo,
and Mian can run wild in Langia.

174
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:26,480
Suowen's been getting away
with this for years.

175
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,919
Just give me the manpower,

176
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:28,919
and I promise I'll bring them in.

177
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,360
No.

178
00:10:31,639 --> 00:10:32,879
Without solid evidence,

179
00:10:33,399 --> 00:10:33,879
the higher-ups

180
00:10:34,399 --> 00:10:35,200
won't let the police act.

181
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:37,879
Then I'll do it myself.

182
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,840
I'll bring Suowen in,

183
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,320
and I'll drag Mian out too.

184
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:43,279
Stop.

185
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,159
What?

186
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:47,240
You won't even follow
your superior's orders?

187
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:53,000
Dad.

188
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,039
What are you so afraid of?

189
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:02,519
Find Tai's body and bring it back now.

190
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,399
Any later,

191
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:05,039
that heart will be useless.

192
00:11:05,039 --> 00:11:05,720
The problem is,

193
00:11:06,039 --> 00:11:07,080
Natuo's men will be here any minute.

194
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:11,480
What about Mian?

195
00:11:13,679 --> 00:11:15,600
Doesn't he hate Natuo
for getting his woman killed?

196
00:11:16,639 --> 00:11:17,480
If I die,

197
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,559
who'll help him keep Natuo in check?

198
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:21,559
Right.

199
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,559
Go find that policewoman.

200
00:11:23,799 --> 00:11:24,000
Okay.

201
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:47,399
(Mona.)

202
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,519
(We need to split up.)

203
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,279
(Go to Suowen's hospital and find proof
that body packers are smuggling drugs.)

204
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,360
(I'll find a way to break up
Natuo and Suowen's alliance.)

205
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,120
(Once you have the evidence,)

206
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,879
(I'll meet you at Suowen's hospital.)

207
00:13:33,799 --> 00:13:34,440
Are you okay?

208
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:35,759
Wake up!

209
00:13:37,639 --> 00:13:38,039
Hey.

210
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,679
How long has she been like this?

211
00:13:50,879 --> 00:13:52,240
Don't waste your time.

212
00:13:52,919 --> 00:13:54,320
They drug us every day.

213
00:13:55,919 --> 00:13:56,320
Look.

214
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:58,360
They're not themselves anymore.

215
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:00,480
I'm a cop.

216
00:14:00,639 --> 00:14:01,600
I can get you out.

217
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:03,240
If you can still move, come with me.

218
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,320
Are you really a cop?

219
00:14:04,919 --> 00:14:05,320
Yes.

220
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:05,879
Come on.

221
00:14:06,519 --> 00:14:07,600
Let's trust her one more time.

222
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:10,600
Nurse...

223
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,159
No, wait.

224
00:14:14,039 --> 00:14:14,879
I should call you

225
00:14:15,639 --> 00:14:16,440
Officer Mona.

226
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,120
Never thought

227
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,120
I'd run into you here.

228
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,872
♪Dust rises along the border♪

229
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:39,152
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

230
00:14:39,210 --> 00:14:40,544
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

231
00:14:40,590 --> 00:14:41,952
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

232
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,152
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

233
00:14:43,210 --> 00:14:44,528
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

234
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,984
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

235
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:47,312
♪My life is mine to bear♪

236
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:50,096
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

237
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,810
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

238
00:14:53,232 --> 00:14:55,310
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

239
00:14:55,310 --> 00:14:56,832
♪My fate is mine to command♪

240
00:14:57,130 --> 00:14:57,952
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

241
00:14:58,030 --> 00:14:59,248
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

242
00:14:59,310 --> 00:15:00,704
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

243
00:15:00,750 --> 00:15:01,968
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

244
00:15:02,010 --> 00:15:03,344
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

245
00:15:03,390 --> 00:15:04,656
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

246
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:05,824
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

247
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:07,232
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

248
00:15:07,290 --> 00:15:08,560
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

249
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,064
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

250
00:15:10,110 --> 00:15:11,280
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

251
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:12,528
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

252
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:15,728
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

253
00:15:18,272 --> 00:15:19,320
♪With blood and sweat♪

254
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,736
♪I forge my glory♪

255
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:21,920
♪In this world of chaos♪

256
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:23,296
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

257
00:15:23,370 --> 00:15:24,688
♪My legend♪

258
00:15:24,688 --> 00:15:26,680
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

259
00:15:30,976 --> 00:15:33,280
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

260
00:15:33,584 --> 00:15:36,090
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

261
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:38,144
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

262
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:39,472
♪My fate is mine to command♪

263
00:15:39,856 --> 00:15:41,470
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

264
00:15:48,990 --> 00:15:50,480
♪My fate is mine to command♪

265
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,590
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
